  "details": "For the past several updates now, I've been having issues with one of my avatars where it kept almost constantly turning into an error bot, so I attempted to clear my cache to see if this would fix it, but when I tried to restart the application would hang on a black screen. I've tested several times and was always consistently happening after a cache clear attempt. I've included two logs below, one without a clear attempt and another after a clear attempt. Should also mention that my cache is unable to be cleared because of this.\nNo clear attempt: https://gist.github.com/SalbugVR/34da9b780862c7e95bcff7249e313715\nAfter clear attempt: https://gist.github.com/SalbugVR/6dcb66894c0a12b38a1758c91e539ab3",
